# Space Weather HF Propagation Rules

- Use NOAA Space Weather Prediction Center (SWPC) public JSON endpoints.
- Parse Kp index from `noaa-planetary-k-index.json` (latest entry).
- Translate geomagnetic storm levels (G1-G5) to expected HF absorption.
